{"data":{"current_page":1,"data":[{"id":1766160,"public_url":"jobs\/channel-partnerships-executive-riseupp-1766160","title":"Channel Partnerships Executive","organization_id":674709,"type":"jobs","subtype":"jobs","regn_open":1,"updated_at":"2026-10-15T12:31:59+05:30","region":"online","visibility":"public","details":"<p><strong>What You'll Work On<\/strong><\/p>\n<ul>\n<li>Identify and recruit new channel partners across India<\/li>\n<li>Meet prospective partners and present RiseUpp's partnership opportunity<\/li>\n<li>Onboard new partners and explain programmes, processes and commercial models<\/li>\n<li>Build and maintain strong relationships with existing channel partners<\/li>\n<li>Train partners on RiseUpp's online degree and certificate offerings<\/li>\n<li>Activate partners and help them generate learner enquiries and admissions<\/li>\n<li>Regularly follow up with partners to improve engagement and productivity<\/li>\n<li>Track partner leads, admissions, revenue and performance<\/li>\n<li>Coordinate with internal sales and admissions teams for partner-generated leads<\/li>\n<li>Identify high-potential cities, markets and partner segments<\/li>\n<li>Resolve partner queries and ensure a smooth partner experience<\/li>\n<li>Maintain partner databases, reports, dashboards and follow-up trackers<\/li>\n<li>Conduct regular field visits and partner meetings across India<\/li>\n<li>Support expansion of RiseUpp's channel partner network across new markets<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p><strong>Who Should Apply<\/strong><\/p>\n<p>We are looking for someone who:<\/p>\n<ul>\n<li>Has strong communication and interpersonal skills<\/li>\n<li>Enjoys meeting new people and building professional relationships<\/li>\n<li>Is comfortable with sales, business development and target-driven work<\/li>\n<li>Has strong follow-up and negotiation skills<\/li>\n<li>Is proactive and comfortable taking ownership<\/li>\n<li>Can independently manage partner meetings and field visits<\/li>\n<li>Is comfortable using Excel, Google Sheets and CRM tools<\/li>\n<li>Is willing to travel regularly across India<\/li>\n<li>Is interested in education, partnerships and business growth<\/li>\n<li>Is comfortable working in a fast-paced startup environment<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p>Candidates with experience in channel sales, education, edtech, admissions, franchise development, business development, field sales or partner management will be preferred.<\/p>\n<p><strong>Job Details<\/strong><\/p>\n<ul>\n<li>Position: Channel Partnerships Executive<\/li>\n<li>Employment Type: Full-time<\/li>\n<li>Role Type: Field-based with regular travel across India<\/li>\n<li>Joining: Immediate \/ Early joiners preferred<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p><strong>Compensation<\/strong><\/p>\n<ul>\n<li>First 3 Months &ndash; Training Period: \u20b925,000\/month fixed<\/li>\n<li>After Successful Completion of Training: \u20b930,000\/month fixed<\/li>\n<li>Incentives: Additional performance-based incentives over and above the fixed salary<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p><strong>What Success Looks Like<\/strong><\/p>\n<p>You will be responsible for building a strong network of productive channel partners who consistently generate learner enquiries and admissions for RiseUpp.<\/p>\n<p>Your performance will primarily be measured on:<\/p>\n<ul>\n<li>New channel partners recruited<\/li>\n<li>Partners successfully onboarded and activated<\/li>\n<li>Active and productive partner network<\/li>\n<li>Learner leads and admissions generated through partners<\/li>\n<li>Revenue generated through the channel network<\/li>\n<li>Partner relationship quality and retention<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p><strong>Why Join RiseUpp?<\/strong><\/p>\n<p>This role gives you the opportunity to build and manage a pan-India partner network and gain hands-on experience in channel sales, partnerships, business development and market expansion.<\/p>\n<p>If you enjoy meeting people, travelling, building relationships and growing business, we would love to hear from you.<\/p>","shor