 Electrical, Fire, Civil or Instrumentation streams\",\"medicine\":[],\"law\":[],\"studentPassoutYearsSelected\":[2027]}","reg_status":"STARTED","remainingDaysArray":{"durations":7,"text":" days left"},"remain_days":"7 days left","remaining_time":643986}},{"id":1755405,"public_url":"jobs\/crp-campus-hiring-gt-sales-2027-aarambh-polycab-1755405","title":"Campus Hiring - GT Sales | 2027","organization_id":136305,"type":"jobs","subtype":"jobs","regn_open":1,"updated_at":"2026-10-13T11:26:00+05:30","region":"online","visibility":"both","details":"<p><strong>POLYCAB INDIA LIMITED<\/strong><\/p>\n<p><strong>Graduate Trainee &ndash; Sales&nbsp;<\/strong><\/p>\n<p><em><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Aarambh 2027&nbsp;<\/span><\/em><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Polycab India Limited (PIL) is India&rsquo;s largest manufacturer of Wires and Cables and one of the fastest growing FMEG companies with a consolidated turnover of \u20b9285+ Bn in FY26. PIL is at the forefront of providing innovative, safe and energy-efficient products to a diverse set of customers via a strong distribution network of 3,900+ authorized dealers and 190,000+ retail outlets. PIL&rsquo;s business operations span across India through 26 manufacturing facilities, 15 offices and 35 warehouses. PIL has also served customers in 94 countries globally. PIL&rsquo;s 4,500+ employees are dedicated to upholding robust governance practices, preserving a customer-centric culture, having a purpose to serve the communities, and imbibing a genuine sense of ecological consciousness.<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">For further information, please visit <\/span><a href=\"http:\/\/www.polycab.com\/\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">www.polycab.com<\/span><\/a><\/p>\n<p><strong>An important note for engineering students: this is a sales role, not a technical or core engineering role. Your engineering background is genuinely useful here &mdash; you will discuss specifications with electricians, contractors and consultants &mdash; but the job itself is commercial and customer-facing. Please apply only if you want to build a career in sales.<\/strong><\/p>\n<h2><strong>Role brief<\/strong><\/h2>\n<p><strong>This is a field sales role. You will spend most of your working day in the market, not in an office, and you will start in a Tier 3 town or city rather than a metro.<\/strong><\/p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">You will be in the market on roughly 20 to 25 days a month, visiting dealers, distributors and retail outlets.<\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">A typical day starts in the market by mid-morning and involves visiting 12 to 20 outlets on a fixed beat plan, mostly on a two-wheeler and on foot.<\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">You will be placed in a Tier 3 town or city where we have business &mdash; not a metro, and not necessarily your home state. This holds for your initial period. Larger territories in Tier 2 cities come later, for those identified as high potential.<\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Saturdays are working days. Market holidays vary by region.<\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">You will not be designing, testing or working in a plant. If that is what you want, look at our Graduate Engineer Trainee programme in manufacturing instead.<\/span><\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p><em><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">If that sounds like the kind of work you want, read on. If it does not, this is not the right role for you &mdash; and that is a perfectly reasonable conclusion to reach.<\/span><\/em><\/p>\n<p><strong>Your first six months: <a href=\"https:\/\/d8it4huxumps7.cloudfront.net\/files\/6ab50a8a0390e_screenshot_2026_09_24_at_5_01_38_pm.png\">Click Here<\/a><\/strong><\/p>\n<h2><strong>Eligibility<\/strong><\/h2>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">2027 batch B.E. \/ B.Tech (Electrical, Electronics, Mechanical or Instrumentation), with no active backlogs<\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Minimum 60% in 10th, 12th and graduation<\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Willing to build a career in sales rather than in a core engineering or technical function<\/span><\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<h2><strong>What we look for<\/strong><\/h2>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Genuine interest in the technical side of the product &mdash; you will need to hold your own with an electrician, a contractor or a consultant<\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Patience and persistence. Demand creation does not pay off immediately.<\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">The ability to build trust with people whose background is very different from your own<\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Willingness to travel and to relocate.<\/span><\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<h2><strong>Who this role suits<\/strong><\/h2>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">You want your engineering knowledge to be useful in a commercial role<\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">You are good at building relationships and willing to invest time in them<\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">You want to understand how large infrastructure and industrial projects come together<\/span><\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<h2><strong>Who it does not suit<\/strong><\/h2>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">You want to work in design, R&amp;D, production or plant operations<\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">You want quick wins and short cycles<\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">You dislike site environments, or are uncomfortable working closely with electricians and contractors on the ground<\/span><\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<h2><strong>Where this leads (B2B)<\/strong><\/h2>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Market Development Manager <\/span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">&rarr;<\/span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> Territory Sales Manager <\/span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">&rarr;<\/span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> Area Sales Manager <\/span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">&rarr;<\/span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> Regional Sales Manager <\/span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">&rarr;<\/span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> National Sales Manager. Movement is based on performance.<\/span><\/p>\n<h2><strong>Where this leads (B2C)<\/strong><\/h2>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Territory Sales In-charge <\/span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">&rarr;<\/span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> Territory Sales Manager <\/span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">&rarr;<\/span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> Area Sales Manager <\/span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">&rarr;<\/span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> Regional Sales Manager <\/span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">&rarr;<\/span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> National Sales Manager. Movement is based on performance.<\/span><\/p>\n<h2><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><strong>Post-Confirmation Compensation<\/strong><\/span><\/h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Post-confirmation CTC, for Sales roles - INR 6,30,000 as Fixed pay + 20% Incentive<\/span><\/li>\n<li><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Post-confirmation CTC, for non-Sales roles - INR 6,30,000 as Fixed pay + 5% Performance pay<\/span><\/li>\n<\/ul>","short_id":"9Zdht1J","logoUrl2":"https:\/\/d8it4huxumps7.cloudfront.net\/uploads\/images\/150x150\/uploadedManual-6ab3b54cd333d_polycab.png","organisation":{"id":136305,"name":"Polycab","public_url":"c\/polycab-recruiter-career-interview-selection-process-job-profile-articles-videos-136305","logoUrl":"https:\/\/d8it4huxumps7.cloudfront.net\/images\/partners\/partners75\/6960c3a128d10_launch_kit_logo_copy.jpg","logoUrl2":"https:\/\/d8it4huxumps7.cloudfront.net\/images\/partners\/partners125\/6960c3a128d10_launch_kit_logo_copy.jpg","show_evaluator_login_link":false,"official_email_domains":"","tier":1},"seo_url":"https:\/\/unstop.com\/jobs\/crp-campus-hiring-gt-sales-2027-aarambh-polycab-1755405","status":"LIVE","tags":[],"thumb":null,"isPaid":false,"festival":{"id":518677,"name":"Aarambh","abbr":null,"organization_id":136305,"organisation":{"id":136305,"name":"Polycab","logo":"6960c3a128d10_launch_kit_logo_copy.jpg"},"start_date":"2026-09-25 10:28:40+05:30","end_date":"2026-10-31 23:59:40+05:30","theme_colour":"amber-dark_un","header_type":0,"footer_type":0,"public_url":"pf\/aarambh-polycab-518677","logoUrl2":"https:\/\/d8it4huxumps7.cloudfront.net\/uploads\/images\/festival\/logo\/150x150\/6ab6005707660_polycab.png","regnRequirements":{"id":2492938,"opportunity_id":null,"festival_id":518677,"max_team_size":null,"min_team_size":null,"start_regn_dt":"2026-09-25T10:28:40+05:30","end_regn_dt":"2026-10-02T10:28:40+05:30","show_deadline":1,"open_for":0,"college_type":0,"same_organisation":1,"study_year_filter":0,"deleted_at":null,"enable_payment":0,"reg_amount":null,"payment_for":0,"service_charge_from":0,"allow_coupons":0,"eligibility":null,"payout_data":null,"gender":["A"],"vendor_id":null,"verified_email":1,"verified_mobile":1,"experience":null,"on