\">For further information, please visit <\/span><a href=\"http:\/\/www.polycab.com\/\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">www.polycab.com<\/span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> <\/span><\/a><\/p>\n<h2><strong>Role brief<\/strong><\/h2>\n<p><strong>This is a field sales role. You will spend most of your working day in the market, not in an office, and you will start in a Tier 3 town or city rather than a metro.<\/strong><\/p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">You will be in the market on roughly 20 to 25 days a month, visiting dealers, distributors and retail outlets.<\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">A typical day starts in the market by mid-morning and involves visiting 12 to 20 outlets on a fixed beat plan, mostly on a two-wheeler and on foot.<\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">You will be placed in a Tier 3 town or city where we have business &mdash; not a metro, and not necessarily your home state. This holds for your initial period. Larger territories in Tier 2 cities come later, for those identified as high potential.<\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Saturdays are working days. Market holidays vary by region and may not match a standard weekend.<\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">This is not a desk role, a marketing role or an analytics role. Reporting and system entries are part of the job, but they happen around market working, not instead of it.<\/span><\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p><em><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">If that sounds like the kind of work you want, read on. If it does not, this is not the right role for you &mdash; and that is a perfectly reasonable conclusion to reach.<\/span><\/em><\/p>\n<h2><strong>Your first six months: <a href=\"https:\/\/d8it4huxumps7.cloudfront.net\/files\/6ab357874aebb_screenshot_2026_09_23_at_10_07_04_am.png\">Click Here<\/a><\/strong><\/h2>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">There are structured check-ins through this period with your mentor and business head, so you always know where you stand. Confirmation follows at six months, based on your progress.<\/span><\/p>\n<h2><strong>After confirmation - Territory Sales In-charge<\/strong><\/h2>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">You own a set of outlets in a Tier 3 market. Broadly, that means:<\/span><\/p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Delivering secondary sales for your outlets, and growing the retailer base<\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Managing dealer and distributor relationships, including stock, claims and collections<\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Expanding reach &mdash; adding outlets, improving counter share, placing new products<\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Executing schemes and promotions, and tracking what they deliver<\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Reading your market &mdash; competition activity, pricing movement, demand shifts &mdash; and reporting it back<\/span><\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<h2><strong>Eligibility<\/strong><\/h2>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">2027 batch MBA (Marketing, Sales or related), with no active backlogs<\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">B.E. \/ B. Tech (Electrical, Electronics, Instrumentation) alongside the MBA&nbsp;<\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Minimum 60% in 10th, 12th and graduation<\/span><\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<h2><strong>What we look for<\/strong><\/h2>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Comfort with people, you will spend your day in conversation with dealers, retailers and customers<\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Resilience. Some days you will hear no more often than yes.<\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Willingness to travel and to relocate<\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Self-direction. Nobody is watching you in the market; you set your own pace.<\/span><\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<h2><strong>Who this role suits<\/strong><\/h2>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">You want to learn how a business actually makes money, at the point where it happens<\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">You are energised by being out and about rather than at a desk<\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">You want a clear, performance-linked path into sales leadership<\/span><\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<h2><strong>Who it does not suit<\/strong><\/h2>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">You are looking for a corporate or head-office role<\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">You want predictable hours in a fixed location<\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">You would prefer a strategy, marketing or analytics profile<\/span><\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<h2><strong>Where this leads<\/strong><\/h2>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Territory Sales In-charge <\/span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">&rarr;<\/span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> Territory Sales Manager <\/span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">&rarr;<\/span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> Area Sales Manager <\/span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">&rarr;<\/span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> Regional Sales Manager <\/span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">&rarr;<\/span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> National Sales Manager. Movement is based on performance.<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><strong>Post-Confirmation Compensation<\/strong><\/span><\/p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Post-confirmation CTC, for Sales roles - INR 7,35,000 as Fixed pay + 20% Incentive<\/span><\/li>\n<li><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Post-confirmation CTC, for non-Sales roles - INR 7,35,000 as Fixed pay + 10% Performance pay<\/span><\/li>\n<\/ul>","short_id":"7sXIOCl","logoUrl2":"https:\/\/d8it4huxumps7.cloudfront.net\/uploads\/images\/150x150\/uploadedManual-6ab357a9d6357_polycab.png","organisation":{"id":136305,"name":"Polycab","public_url":"c\/polycab-recruiter-career-interview-selection-process-job-profile-articles-videos-136305","logoUrl":"https:\/\/d8it4huxumps7.cloudfront.net\/images\/partners\/partners75\/6960c3a128d10_launch_kit_logo_copy.jpg","logoUrl2":"https:\/\/d8it4huxumps7.cloudfront.net\/images\/partners\/partners125\/6960c3a128d10_launch_kit_logo_copy.jpg","show_evaluator_login_link":false,"official_email_domains":"","tier":1},"seo_url":"https:\/\/unstop.com\/jobs\/crp-campus-hiring-pgt-sales-2027-aarambh-polycab-1755458","status":"LIVE","tags":[],"thumb":null,"isPaid":false,"festival":{"id":518677,"name":"Aarambh","abbr":null,"organization_id":136305,"organisation":{"id":136305,"name":"Polycab","logo":"6960c3a128d10_launch_kit_logo_copy.jpg"},"start_date":"2026-09-25 10:28:40+05:30","end_date":"2026-10-31 23:59:40+05:30","theme_colour":"amber-dark_un","header_type":0,"footer_type":0,"public_url":"pf\/aarambh-polycab-518677","logoUrl2":"https:\/\/d8it4huxumps7.cl